* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary

# Delivery mirrors are byte-frozen: each one carries its own SHA256SUMS, so an
# EOL rewrite on commit would make the published bytes disagree with the
# manifest that is published beside them.  Keep them exactly as they are.
deliverables/** -text
